# Copy to config.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Environment variables of the same names win.
# Your paid Apple Developer team ID, 10 capital letters and digits. The sure place to find it:
# developer.apple.com > Account > Membership details, "Team ID" (Xcode's Accounts pane may not show
# it, and the code in an "Apple Development" certificate's name is a different identifier: do not use
# it). A free Personal Team cannot sign DriverKit drivers.
RMNET_TEAM_ID=
# A bundle ID you own, for the app; the driver gets <this>.driver. Example: com.example.RMNet
RMNET_BUNDLE_ID=
